; SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; ModemManager returns the owned eSIM profile transport, one end of an AF_UNIX
; SOCK_SEQPACKET socketpair (class unix_stream_socket), from
; OpenLumaProfileTransport*. dbus-broker must be able to receive that
; descriptor to forward it to luma-esim-service. The base policy only
; dontaudits it, so the refusal is silent: dbus-broker drops ModemManager's
; connection, ModemManager loses its bus name and exits, and cellular goes
; down with it.
;
; The activation-code pipe Settings passes to Download is already allowed
; (systemprocess -> initrc_transition_domain fifo_file).
(allow system_dbusd_t modemmanager_t (unix_stream_socket (read write)))
